---
// apps/main-site/src/components/AboutSection.astro
---
<section class="py-16 px-4 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-900 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
            <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-blue-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-blue-600"></span>
          </span>
          Who we are
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
          The Originator of the <span class="text-blue-700">"Without Walls"</span> Service Model
        </h2>

        <div class="prose prose-lg text-slate-600 space-y-4">
          <p>
            <strong>Another Step, Inc.</strong> was founded in Rockland County, NY in 1992 to provide an alternative to traditional services. While we began in the family home, we have steadily expanded to encompass a wide range of community-based supports.
          </p>
          <p>
            We have been a leader in providing Day Services without using a facility. Today, over one hundred people in <strong>Rockland and Westchester Counties</strong> receive services 100% in their own community.
          </p>
          <p>
            Supporting people as individuals and respecting their choices continues to be the essence of what we do. We are an organization that truly lives its mission and embraces person-centered supports.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl border border-slate-100 relative z-10">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-6">Our Reach & Impact</h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-yellow-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">100% Community Based</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Serving Rockland & Westchester Counties without the use of restrictive facilities.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-900 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-white">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Residential Opportunities</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Including five supervised residences (IRAs) and independent rental subsidies.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
              <p class="text-sm italic text-slate-400">Founded in 1992</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-64 h-64 bg-yellow-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 -z-0"></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>